          "statement": "Let $p$ be the single Hermite piece from [[def-piecewise-cubic-hermite-interpolant]] on $[x_0,x_1]$, with $h=x_1-x_0>0$, endpoint values $y_0,y_1$, slopes $m_0,m_1$, and secant $d=(y_1-y_0)/h$. If $d\\ne0$ and $\\alpha=m_0/d$, $\\beta=m_1/d$ both lie in $[0,3]$, then $p$ is monotone from $y_0$ to $y_1$ and stays between those values. If $d=0$ and $m_0=m_1=0$, then $p$ is constant."
