        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "lem-full-column-rank-matrix-least-squares-solution",
    "kind": "lemma",
    "title": "Full-column-rank matrix least squares has a unique minimizer",
    "statement": "Let $p,r,s\\ge1$, let $M\\in\\mathbb F^{p\\times r}$ have full column rank, and let $Y\\in\\mathbb F^{p\\times s}$. Among all $W\\in\\mathbb F^{r\\times s}$, the function $W\\mapsto\\|Y-MW\\|_F$ has the unique minimizer\n$$ W_*=(M^*M)^{-1}M^*Y. $$",
