          },
          "statement": "Let $k\\ge1$, let $z_1,\\ldots,z_k\\in\\mathbb C$ be distinct, and let\n$w_1,\\ldots,w_k\\in\\mathbb C$ be nonzero. Then the polynomial\n$$\nQ(z)=\\sum_{j=1}^kw_j\\prod_{\\ell\\ne j}(z-z_\\ell)\n$$\nis not identically zero."
