  {
    "id": "lem-euler-count-for-planar-triangulation",
    "kind": "lemma",
    "title": "Euler counting for a finite planar triangulation",
    "deps": [
      "def-planar-delaunay-voronoi-structures"
    ],
    "dependency_level": 3,
    "statement": "For a finite triangulation of the convex hull of $n$ distinct planar sites of affine dimension two, let $k$ be the number of sites on the hull boundary, $E$ the number of edges, and $T$ the number of bounded triangular faces. Then\n$$3T=2E-k,\\qquad n-E+T=1,$$\nand consequently $T=2n-2-k$ and $E=3n-3-k$.",
