    "id": "alg-hlr-block-matvec",
    "kind": "algorithm",
    "title": "H-matrix block matrix-vector multiplication",
    "statement": "**Input:** An H-matrix representation $\\widetilde A$ on a finite block-cluster partition $\\mathcal P$ as in [[def-hlr-and-h2-block-matrix-representations]], and a vector $x\\in\\mathbb F^J$.\n\n**Procedure:** Initialize $y\\in\\mathbb F^I$ to zero. For every far block $b=(\\tau,\\sigma)$ with factors $U_b,V_b$, compute $z_b=V_b^*x|_\\sigma$ and add $U_bz_b$ to $y|_\\tau$. For every near block with dense entries $D_b$, compute $D_bx|_\\sigma$ and add it to $y|_\\tau$. Return $y$. All arithmetic is exact; contributions to a row cluster are summed over its block leaves.",
