    "id": "lem-three-dimensional-laplace-spherical-harmonic-addition-theorem",
    "kind": "lemma",
    "title": "Three-dimensional Laplace spherical-harmonic addition theorem",
    "statement": "For every integer $\\ell\\ge0$, the space $\\mathcal H_\\ell$ of [[def-three-dimensional-spherical-harmonic-space]] has dimension $2\\ell+1$. For any orthonormal basis $\\{Y_{\\ell m}:-\\ell\\le m\\le\\ell\\}$, there is a basis-independent normalized zonal polynomial $P_\\ell$ such that\n$$\\sum_{m=-\\ell}^{\\ell}Y_{\\ell m}(\\omega)\\overline{Y_{\\ell m}(\\omega')}=\\frac{2\\ell+1}{4\\pi}P_\\ell(\\omega\\cdot\\omega'),\\qquad P_\\ell(1)=1.$$\nIt obeys $|P_\\ell(t)|\\le1$ for $-1\\le t\\le1$ and the generating identity\n$$\\frac1{\\sqrt{1-2rt+r^2}}=\\sum_{\\ell=0}^{\\infty}r^\\ell P_\\ell(t),\\qquad -1\\le t\\le1,\\quad 0\\le r<1.$$",
