          "statement": "Let a periodic MPS presentation have order $d\\ge2$, positive cyclic bond sizes $r_0,\\ldots,r_d$ with $r_d=r_0$, and matrices $A_k^{(i_k)}\\in\\mathbb F^{r_{k-1}\\times r_k}$. It has an exactly equal open-boundary TT presentation with internal bond sizes $s_k=r_k r_0$ for $1\\le k<d$. In the pair index convention $(a_k,a_0)$, define\n$$G_1(1,i_1,(a_1,a_0))=(A_1^{(i_1)})_{a_0,a_1},$$\n$$G_k((a_{k-1},b_0),i_k,(a_k,c_0))=\\delta_{b_0c_0}(A_k^{(i_k)})_{a_{k-1},a_k}\\quad(2\\le k<d,\\ 1\\le b_0,c_0\\le r_0),$$\nwhere $\\delta_{b_0c_0}=1$ for $b_0=c_0$ and $0$ otherwise, so every middle-core entry with unequal carried indices is zero,\nand\n$$G_d((a_{d-1},a_0),i_d,1)=(A_d^{(i_d)})_{a_{d-1},a_0}.$$\nFor $d=2$ the middle-core clause is empty.",
