    "dependency_level": 2,
    "statement": "Fix constant transport velocity $\\beta\\in\\mathbb R^d$ and SBP data from [[def-pe04-diagonal-norm-sbp-element-data]]. For each cell $K$, let $U_K(t)$ be the vector of nodal values, $Q_{K,\\ell}=H_KD_{K,\\ell}$, and $U_{K,F}=R_{K,F}U_K$. Set $b_{K,F}=\\beta\\cdot n_{K,F}$. At each interior face, use the trace from the cell with positive outward speed when $b_{K,F}>0$, and the neighboring trace when $b_{K,F}<0$; at boundary faces use the inflow data on $b_{K,F}<0$ and the interior trace on $b_{K,F}\\ge0$. Denote this upwind scalar trace by $\\widehat U_{K,F}$.\n\nThe **upwind SBP-SAT semidiscretization** is\n$$H_K\\dot U_K+\\sum_{\\ell=1}^d\\beta_\\ell Q_{K,\\ell}U_K+\\sum_{F\\subset\\partial K}R_{K,F}^{T}M_{K,F}\\,b_{K,F}(\\widehat U_{K,F}-U_{K,F})=0.$$\nThe sign of the SAT correction is fixed by this equation. The definition is spatial only and makes no fully discrete claim.",
