    "dependency_level": 0,
    "strategy": "Fully author the complete locally proved proposal at research/numerical-analysis-remaining-71-2026-10-17-ROOT-mini-pressure-supplier-cycle4/proposed-items/lem-na-halfline-heat-logarithmic-mass-loss.md; preserve exact original domain, force, initial-data and mesh scope. The generated counterexample is contextual, never a logical supplier.",
    "provenance": {
