    "justified_by": [],
    "dependency_level": 1,
    "statement": "In the setting of [[def-pe26-scalar-substructuring-model]], the nullspace of the floating local energy matrix on a connected $\\Omega_i$ is exactly the one-dimensional space of constants. The principal stiffness block $K_{II}^{(i)}$ on interior nodal values with zero boundary trace is positive definite (including the empty $0$-dimensional block convention). The assembled global Dirichlet stiffness matrix is positive definite.",
