    "statement": "Let $L>0$, odd $N\\ge3$, $h=L/N$, and $f\\in C^2(\\mathbb T_L^d)$ for $d\\in\\{1,2,3\\}$. With the uniform tensor grid $x_j=hj$ and indices taken modulo $N$,\n$$ \\left|h^d\\sum_{j\\in(\\mathbb Z/N\\mathbb Z)^d}f(x_j)-\\int_{[0,L]^d}f(x)\\,dx\\right| \\le \\frac{L^dh^2}{12}\\sum_{a=1}^d\\|\\partial_{aa}f\\|_\\infty . $$"
