estimate has mesh- and epsilon-dependent constants and is not a quantitative spatial estimate. No d>=2 convergence theorem or additional conforming FE error branch is required by this selected dimension-qualified route. Retain the general continuous definitions, explicit d=2/d=3 quartic-energy embedding caveats and finite-energy class, and every SAV/stabilized and sharp-interface limitation.\"}",
